# Plans hold personal financial data. Keep yours outside this folder (./plan new us ~/retirement-plan),
# or in my-plans/. These rules also catch a plan folder created directly inside the repo.
my-plans/
*/plan.xlsx
!examples/*/plan.xlsx
*/PLANNING.md
!templates/PLANNING.md
*/inputs/
!examples/*/inputs/
**/statements/*
!examples/*/statements/
!examples/*/statements/**
**/ledger/
**/backups/
demo-us/
demo-ca/
.~lock.*#
~$*.xlsx
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.DS_Store
